<p><strong class=3D"example">Example 1:</strong></p>
<pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums =3D [0,1,0,3,12]
<strong>Output:</strong> [1,3,12,0,0]
</pre><p><strong class=3D"example">Example 2:</strong></p>
<pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums =3D [0]
<strong>Output:</strong> [0]
</pre>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>

<ul>
